@summary_2023
title: Election summary
new-page: true
view-if: left_seats > 0
on-arrival: election_summary_seen = 1

= The result

PiS returns with **[+ pis_seats +] seats**. KO, the democratic centre and the
Left parties committed to the transfer hold **[+ coalition_democratic_seats +]
seats**. [? if third_way_split = 0: [+ third_way_display_name +]'s **[+ p2050_seats + psl_seats
+] deputies** won election through one committee.[? if
sejm_electoral_system != "fptp_460": Their later division into PSL and Poland
2050 caucuses does not retroactively change its 8% threshold.?][? if
sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460": Its member parties shared one candidate
pact, and seats are credited to the winning nominees.?]?]
[? if third_way_split = 1 and sejm_electoral_system != "fptp_460": PSL and
Poland 2050 fought on separate 5% lists, so their seats were calculated
separately.?][? if third_way_split = 1 and sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460":
PSL and Poland 2050 filed separate district candidates, so their seats were
counted separately.?]

The main **[+ left_party_name +]** list returns with **[+ left_seats +]
seats**. Separate Left parties hold **[+ left_splinter_seats +]** more.
The wider Left won **[+ left_family_vote_intent +]%**. [? if
sejm_electoral_system != "fptp_460": It contested through **[+
left_lists_contesting +] lists**. **[+ left_lists_above_threshold +]** cleared
their filed threshold; **[+ left_threshold_wasted_vote +] points** were cast
through committees that won no representation under the national indicator.
The negotiated form was **[+ sejm_list_structure +]** at **[+
sejm_list_threshold +]%**: [+ sejm_list_members +].?][? if
sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460": Its filed committee and candidate pacts
won **[+ left_urban_seats +] urban** and **[+ left_rural_seats +] rural**
constituencies; there was no national threshold.?]
Inside the main list there are **[+ nowa_lewica_seats +] Nowa Lewica**, **[+
razem_seats +] Razem** and **[+ left_pps_seats +] PPS** deputies. Cabinet
entry therefore requires both coalition arithmetic and an internal mandate.

- @senate_results_2023: Certify the Senate

@senate_results_2023
title: 2023 Senate election
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: election_senate_seen = 1

= One hundred district pluralities

The Senate is not apportioned from the national Sejm result. The simulation
counted **one contest in each of 100 single-member districts** and awarded
each seat to the candidate with the largest district vote. There is no
national threshold and no proportional correction.

Campaign arrangement: **[+ senate_pact_strategy +]**.
Rule: **[+ senate_election_rule +]**.
Closest simulated winning margin: **[+ senate_election_closest_margin +]
points**.

<div class="election-table election-tree election-tree--senate">
<div class="election-table-head"><span>Bloc / party</span><span>Seats</span><span>Position</span><span>Status</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--committee election-tree-row--broad"><span class="party party-ko">Democratic camp</span><b>[+ senate_democratic_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>all district winners</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-ko">Koalicja Obywatelska</span><b>[+ senate_ko_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>party nominees</span></div>
[? if result_member_po_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--grandchild"><span class="party party-ko">[+ result_member_po_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_po_senate +]</b><span>KO member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_ko_party_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--grandchild"><span class="party party-ko">[+ result_member_ko_party_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_ko_party_senate +]</b><span>KO member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if senate_p2050_seats + senate_psl_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-third-way">Trzecia Droga</span><b>[+ senate_p2050_seats + senate_psl_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>all member winners</span></div>?]
[? if senate_p2050_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--grandchild"><span class="party party-p2050">Polska 2050</span><b>[+ senate_p2050_seats +]</b><span>Third Way member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if senate_psl_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--grandchild"><span class="party party-psl">PSL</span><b>[+ senate_psl_seats +]</b><span>Third Way member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if senate_left_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-lewica">Lewica</span><b>[+ senate_left_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
<div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--committee election-tree-row--right"><span class="party party-pis">Zjednoczona Prawica</span><b>[+ senate_pis_seats +]</b><span>right</span><span>all district winners</span></div>
[? if result_member_pis_party_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-pis">[+ result_member_pis_party_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_pis_party_senate +]</b><span>ZP member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_solidarna_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-pis">[+ result_member_solidarna_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_solidarna_senate +]</b><span>ZP member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_porozumienie_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-pis">[+ result_member_porozumienie_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_porozumienie_senate +]</b><span>ZP member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if senate_konf_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--committee election-tree-row--right"><span class="party party-konf">Konfederacja</span><b>[+ senate_konf_seats +]</b><span>right</span><span>all district winners</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_nowa_nadzieja_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-konf">[+ result_member_nowa_nadzieja_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_nowa_nadzieja_senate +]</b><span>Konf. member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_ruch_narodowy_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-konf">[+ result_member_ruch_narodowy_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_ruch_narodowy_senate +]</b><span>Konf. member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if result_member_kkp_senate > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--child"><span class="party party-konf">[+ result_member_kkp_name +]</span><b>[+ result_member_kkp_senate +]</b><span>Konf. member</span><span>party nominees</span></div>?]
[? if senate_independent_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row election-tree-row--committee"><span>Independent candidates</span><b>[+ senate_independent_seats +]</b><span>unaligned</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
</div>

**Democratic senators: [+ senate_democratic_seats +] · right-aligned
senators: [+ senate_right_seats +] · independents: [+
senate_independent_seats +].** The chamber is a **[+ senate_control +]**.

- @coalitions_2023: Examine governing arrangements

@coalitions_2023
title: Coalition arrangements
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.election_coalition_seen = 1;
const leftFamilySeatCeiling =
    Q.left_seats + Q.sld_breakaway_seats + Q.social_patriot_seats +
    Q.spring_breakaway_seats +
    Q.labor_left_seats + Q.young_left_seats +
    Q.razem_party_seats + Q.pps_party_seats + Q.tak_rozwoj_seats;
if (
    !Number.isFinite(Number(Q.left_committed_seats)) ||
    Q.left_committed_seats < Q.left_seats ||
    Q.left_committed_seats > leftFamilySeatCeiling
) {
    Q.left_splinter_support_votes =
        (Q.barons_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.sld_breakaway_seats : 0) +
        (!["pis", "konf"].includes(Q.social_patriot_list_committee) &&
            Q.social_patriot_party_relation >= 45
            ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0) +
        (Q.spring_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.spring_breakaway_seats : 0) +
        (Q.labor_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.labor_left_seats : 0) +
        (Q.progressives_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.young_left_seats : 0) +
        (Q.razem_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.razem_party_seats : 0) +
        (Q.pps_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.pps_party_seats : 0) +
        (Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation >= 45 ? Q.tak_rozwoj_seats : 0);
    Q.left_committed_seats =
        Q.left_seats + Q.left_splinter_support_votes;
}
const leftOnRightListCoalition = ["pis_5", "konf_5"].includes(
    String(Q.sejm_list_outcome || "left_5")
);
Q.coalition_democratic_seats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.psl_seats +
    Q.centrum_seats +
    (leftOnRightListCoalition ? 0 : Q.left_committed_seats);
Q.coalition_right_seats =
    Q.pis_seats + Q.konf_seats + Q.rozwoj_seats + Q.korona_seats +
    (leftOnRightListCoalition ? Q.left_seats : 0) +
    (["pis", "konf"].includes(Q.social_patriot_list_committee)
        ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0);
Q.coalition_center_seats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.psl_seats + Q.centrum_seats;
Q.coalition_pis_psl_seats = Q.pis_seats + Q.psl_seats +
    (Q.social_patriot_list_committee == "pis"
        ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0);
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_democratic_score))) {
    Q.coalition_democratic_score = 67;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_right_score))) {
    Q.coalition_right_score = 28;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_center_score))) {
    Q.coalition_center_score = 61;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_pis_psl_score))) {
    Q.coalition_pis_psl_score = 36;
}
!}

= Possible governments

<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_democratic_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>KO · democratic centre · Left parties</span><b>[+ coalition_democratic_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_democratic_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_democratic_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_center_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>KO · PL2050 · PSL</span><b>[+ coalition_center_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_center_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_center_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_pis_psl_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>PiS · PSL</span><b>[+ coalition_pis_psl_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_pis_psl_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_pis_psl_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_right_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>PiS · Konfederacja[? if social_patriot_list_committee = "pis":  · Lewica Patriotyczna?]</span><b>[+ coalition_right_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_right_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_right_score +]/100</small></div>

The numbers identify possibilities, not agreements. The formation sequence
will test relations, party resources and caucus defections. The Senate does
not appoint the cabinet, but a **[+ senate_control +]** will review every bill.
[? if senate_right_seats >= 51: A democratic Sejm cabinet would need an
absolute majority to remove hostile Senate amendments; a coalition that can
pass an ordinary bill may still fail that override.?]
[? if senate_democratic_seats >= 51: A democratic cabinet begins with a
friendly upper chamber, while a right cabinet would face the same amendment
problem.?]

- @poland_government_formation.first_sitting: Begin government formation

@campaign_projection
# prose-audit: Grade B — Accurate and genuinely useful as a projection screen: the d'Hondt caveat, the 8% coalition threshold and the filed-committee line are all correct. It is a dashboard rather than an event, with two sentences of prose above a table and a chart; graded as the utility screen it is.
title: July 2023 election readiness
face-image: img/poland/events/election-2023-ballot.webp
new-page: true
call: poland_polling
on-arrival: {!
Q.timeline_complete = 0;
Q.poland_historical_event_phase = 0;
Q.news_headline = "The campaign enters its final election summer";
const formatIntent = function(value) {
    const numeric = Number(value);
    return (Number.isFinite(numeric) ? numeric : 0).toFixed(1);
};
[
    "left_committee_poll", "pis_vote_intent", "ko_vote_intent",
    "p2050_vote_intent", "left_vote_intent",
    "sld_breakaway_vote_intent", "social_patriot_vote_intent",
    "spring_breakaway_component_vote_intent",
    "labor_left_component_vote_intent",
    "young_left_component_vote_intent", "razem_component_vote_intent",
    "pps_vote_intent", "centrum_vote_intent", "rozwoj_vote_intent",
    "p0_vote_intent",
    "tak_rozwoj_component_vote_intent", "ko_splinter_component_vote_intent",
    "suwerenna_component_vote_intent", "porozumienie_component_vote_intent",
    "republikanie_component_vote_intent", "odnowa_component_vote_intent",
    "kukiz_component_vote_intent",
    "korona_vote_intent", "psl_vote_intent", "konf_vote_intent",
    "new_hope_component_vote_intent",
    "national_movement_component_vote_intent",
    "duda_component_vote_intent",
    "social_conservative_component_vote_intent",
    "right_2027_poll", "common_centre_2027_poll",
    "third_way_2027_poll", "social_conservative_2027_poll"
].forEach(function(key) {
    Q[key + "_display"] = formatIntent(Q[key]);
});
Q.third_way_vote_intent_display = formatIntent(
    (Number(Q.p2050_component_vote_intent) || 0) +
    (Number(Q.psl_component_vote_intent) || 0)
);
!}
on-display: {!
const data = [];
const projectionParties = [
    ["left", Q.left_party_short_name || "Lewica", Q.left_party_long_name || Q.left_party_name || "Lewica", Q.left_projected_seats],
    ["sld_breakaway", "SLD", Q.barons_party_name, Q.sld_breakaway_projected_seats],
    ["social_patriot", "LP", Q.social_patriot_party_name, Q.social_patriot_projected_seats],
    ["spring_breakaway", "Spring", Q.spring_party_name, Q.spring_breakaway_projected_seats],
    ["labor_left", "Labour", Q.labor_party_name, Q.labor_left_projected_seats],
    ["young_left", "Young", Q.progressives_party_name, Q.young_left_projected_seats],
    ["razem", "Razem", "Razem", Q.razem_projected_seats],
    ["pps", "PPS", "PPS", Q.pps_projected_seats],
    ["tak_rozwoj", "Tak!", Q.tak_rozwoj_party_name || "Tak! Dla Rozwoju", Q.tak_rozwoj_projected_seats],
    ["ko", "KO", "KO", Q.ko_projected_seats],
    ["ko_splinter", "KO-S", Q.ko_splinter_name || "KO breakaway", Q.ko_splinter_projected_seats],
    ["centrum", "Centrum", "Unia Centrum", Q.centrum_projected_seats],
    ["pis", "PiS", "PiS", Q.pis_projected_seats],
    ["rozwoj", "Rozwój+", "Rozwój Plus", Q.rozwoj_projected_seats],
    ["p0", Q.p0_short_name || "P0", Q.p0_name || "Partia Zero", Q.p0_projected_seats],
    ["konf", "Konf.", "Konfederacja", Q.konf_projected_seats],
    ["korona", "Korona", "Korona", Q.korona_projected_seats],
    ["new_hope", "NN", "Nowa Nadzieja", Q.new_hope_projected_seats],
    ["national_movement", "RN", "Ruch Narodowy", Q.national_movement_projected_seats],
    ["duda", "Duda", "Ruch Dudy", Q.duda_projected_seats],
    ["suwerenna", "SP", "Solidarna / Suwerenna Polska", Q.suwerenna_projected_seats],
    ["porozumienie", "Por.", "Porozumienie", Q.porozumienie_projected_seats],
    ["republikanie", "PR", "Partia Republikańska", Q.republikanie_projected_seats],
    ["odnowa", "OdNowa", "OdNowa RP", Q.odnowa_projected_seats],
    ["kukiz", "K'15", "Kukiz'15", Q.kukiz_projected_seats],
    ["social_conservative", "Soc.", "Konserwatyści społeczni", Q.social_conservative_projected_seats]
];
if (Q.third_way_joint_list) {
    projectionParties.splice(
        10,
        0,
        [
            "third_way",
            "Third Way",
            "Trzecia Droga",
            Q.third_way_projected_seats
        ]
    );
} else {
    projectionParties.splice(
        10,
        0,
        ["psl", "PSL", "PSL", Q.psl_projected_seats],
        ["p2050", "PL2050", "Polska 2050", Q.p2050_projected_seats]
    );
}
for (const party of projectionParties) {
    if (party[3] > 0) {
        data.push({
            id: party[0],
            legend: party[1],
            name: party[2],
            seats: party[3]
        });
    }
}
if (
    typeof window !== "undefined" &&
    typeof d3 !== "undefined" &&
    document.getElementById("poland-projection")
) {
    let width = 500;
    let height = 500;
    const content = document.getElementById("content");
    if (content && content.offsetWidth < 450) {
        width = Math.max(260, content.offsetWidth - 30);
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("poland-projection").style.height =
            Math.round(width / 2) + "px";
    }
    const parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#poland-projection").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

= Election readiness — July 2023

This is an election-model projection, not a claim that an election occurred.
[? if sejm_electoral_system = "proportional": All 460 seats use the current
national d'Hondt indicator and filed thresholds.?]
[? if sejm_electoral_system = "mixed_230": The projection combines 230
d'Hondt list seats with 138 urban and 92 rural single-member contests.?]
[? if sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460": All seats are projected from 276
urban and 184 rural single-member plurality contests. National thresholds do
not apply; filed alliances pool their candidate vote.?]
[? if third_way_joint_list = 1 and sejm_electoral_system != "fptp_460": PSL and Poland 2050 enter the calculation once,
as **Third Way**, under the **8% coalition-list threshold**. The displayed
partner seats are an internal division of that committee's seats.?]

Filed Sejm arrangement: **[+ sejm_list_result +]** — [? if
sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460": **district candidate pact**.?][? if
sejm_electoral_system != "fptp_460": **[+
sejm_list_structure +]**, **[+ sejm_list_threshold +]% threshold**. [+
sejm_list_control +].?]

Projected Lewica seats: **[+ left_projected_list_seats +] list · [+
left_projected_urban_seats +] urban · [+ left_projected_rural_seats +]
rural**.

{!<svg id="poland-projection" class="poland-sejm-chart"></svg>!}

